From c33cc4dd182fa4274a290787930815bfd3aeaa30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yong Wook Lee <icerain@jj.ac.kr>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 18:17:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] fix(hegi): supervise quiet-meeting approval pipeline

The prior fix depended on a standalone daemon that could die while leaving stale readiness files. Run the quiet-meeting detector and approval recovery inside the enabled plugin, sharing daemon.lock so standalone and gateway workers cannot duplicate reports. Regression tests cover startup, lock exclusion, and reply-only approval guidance.
